<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="a897de46">&lt;h3&gt;
    When to apply this&amp;nbsp;capability
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    This capabiity should be applied in any engagement where small scale project management work is involved. This should
    not be confused with engagement service quality management.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;
    Getting started
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    If you are generally not familiar with this capability, please navigate through its welcome page contents and
    the&amp;nbsp;Project Management (Small) method navigation pane to see how tasks, work products and guidance from this
    capability are integrated.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;
    Common pitfalls
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    This capability is solely for very small projects and engagement teams, please scale and match the appropriate project
    management delivery process with the client service needs for the engagement.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
